title: DDP Media
new-page: true

# Ripped from Cascadian Ptriot's amazing DDP mod

@media
title: Media
view-if: ddp_media_timer <= 0 and ddp_rally_timer > 0 and (labor_minister_party != "DDP" or labor_affairs_post_timer != 0 or strike_term_seen_post_timer != 0)

The DDP will invest in liberal media

- @berlinertagblad
- @diehilfe
- @echoderjungedemokratie
- @integrate1
- @integrate2
- @integrate3
- @bolsterpartymedia
- @debate
- @partymedia

@berlinertagblad
title: The DDP will fund the Berliner Tageblatt
subtitle: -1 resource. The biggest left-liberal publisher in Germany, edited by prominent DDP member Theodor Wolff.
view-if: {!
    if (bt_integrated) {
        if (Q.ddp_resources >= 1) {
            return true;
        } else {
            return false;
        } 
    } else {
        return false;
    }
    
!} 

The DDP has funded the Berliner Tageblatt, and with its wide circulation, we see a noticeable increase in support for the DDP and for democracy.

@diehilfe
title: The DDP will fund Die Hilfe.
subtitle: -1 resource, edited by herr Gertrud Bäumer himself.
view-if: ddp_resources >= 1 and dh_integrated == 0

Funding Die Hilfe certainly benefits the DDP, as the editors are their most loyal members.

@echoderjungedemokratie
title: The DDP will fund the Echo der Junge Demokratie.
subtitle: -1 resource, the newspaper of their Youth wing, herr Ludwig Quidde also publishes his writings here.
view-if: ddp_resources >= 1 and edjd_integrated == 0

The DDP have supported their youth wing's newspaper, to which they have responded with enthusiasm, and with its circulation, support for pacifism has grown within the party.

@integrate1
title: The DDP will integrate Die Hilfe into their newspaper.
subtitle: [? if die_hilfe < 1 : -1 resources ?][? if die_hilfe >= 1 : Their investments into Die Hilfe has reduced the cost close to nil ?]
view-if: ddp_resources >= 1 and ddp_newspaper_founded = 1 and dh_integrated = 0 and (ddp_newspaper_editor = "Erkelenz" or ddp_newspaper_editor = "Bäumer")

The DDP has integrated Die Hilfe into their newspaper network, growing its influence significantly, and bringing with it funding and popularity.

@integrate2
title: The DDP will integrate Echo der Junge Demokratie into their newspaper.
subtitle: [? if junge_demokratie < 3 : -2 resources ?][? if junge_demokratie >= 3 : -1 resource, their investments into Echo der Junge Demokratie has reduced the cost ?]
view-if: ddp_newspaper_founded = 1 and edjd_integrated = 0 and (ddp_newspaper_editor = "Erkelenz" or ddp_newspaper_editor = "Quide")

THE DDP has integrated Echo der Junge Demokratie into their newspaper network, growing the influence of pacifism within the party.

@integrate3
title: The DDP will integrate Berliner Tageblatt into their newspaper.
subtitle: [? if berliner_tegeblatt < 5 : -5 resources ?][? if berliner_tegeblatt >= 5 : -3 resource, their investments into Berliner Tageblatt has reduced the cost ?]
view-if: ddp_newspaper_founded = 1 and edjd_integrated = 0 and (ddp_newspaper_editor = "Erkelenz" or ddp_newspaper_editor = "Heuss")

THE DDP has integrated Berliner Tageblatt into their newspaper network, though some within the party have expressed concern at its already-outsized influence within the DDP's newspaper network.

@bolsterpartymedia
title: The DDP will continue to develop their newspaper network.
subtitle: [? if ddp_newspaper >= 3 : -1 resource. ?][? if ddp_newspaper < 3 : It is now financially self-sufficient and doesn't require further resources to grow. ?]
view-if: ddp_newspaper_founded = 1

The DDP's newspaper network has a mix of popular and political programming, and is proving a success in spreading our meseage.

@debate
title: The DDP will have vibrant ideological debates in their party newspaper.
view-if: ddp_newspaper_founded = 1

The DDP's hosting of ideological debates within their party newspaper has successfully paved over the many tensions within their party.

@partymedia
title: The DDP will create their own official media
subtitle: -2 resources.
view-if: ddp_resources >= 2 and ddp_newspaper_founded = 0

We have founded our own newspaper, and we must now select its head editor.

- @heuss
- @quide
- @baumer
- @erkelenz

@heuss
title: Theodor Heuss, a rising star with a patriotic attitute.
view-if: ddp_regionalist_strength + ddp_business_strength > ddp_labor_strength + ddp_liberal_strength

The right has managed to appoint Theodor Heuss to the position of chief editor.

@quide
title: Ludwig Quidde, notable pacifist.
view-if: (ddp_labor_strength + ddp_liberal_strength > ddp_regionalist_strength + ddp_business_strength) and not (ddp_labor_strength > ddp_regionalist_strength + ddp_business_strength + ddp_liberal_strength)

Ludiwg quide has been appointed chief editor.

@baumer
title: Gertrud Bäumer, prominent feminist.
view-if: ddp_liberal_strength + ddp_regionalist_strength > ddp_business_strength + ddp_labor_strength

Following a deadlock in deciding upon chief editor, Gertrud Bäumer has been appointed as a compromise

@erkelenz
title: Anton Erkelenz, the labour leader.
view-if: ddp_labor_strength > ddp_regionalist_strength + ddp_business_strength + ddp_liberal_strength

The left has managed to appoint Anton Erkelenz to he position of cheif editor.